### 10. Sources and provenance of this design

The founder record is the source of intent. The linked NSM, FrameNet, VerbNet, WordNet, PropBank, USAS, NRC, SentiWordNet, Kaikki, concreteness, Lancaster and ConceptNet pages above are primary documentation for their own field meanings. The local [Significance Weighting paper](</Users/rohanvinaik/Projects/rohan-vinaik.github.io/papers/Core Documents/SIGNIFICANCE_WEIGHTING.md>) informs the separation between conditional coverage and downstream inferential richness. The local [Constrained Hallucination paper](</Users/rohanvinaik/Projects/rohan-vinaik.github.io/papers/Core Documents/CONSTRAINED_HALLUCINATION_PAPER.md>) informs the bounded model role; its narrative claims do not themselves validate a lexicon sign. [Wayfinder's README](/Users/rohanvinaik/Projects/Wayfinder/README.md) offers the analogous structure-first, small-residual workflow. The [Fable consultation comparison](../verification/lexicon-rebuild/readings/founder-design-consult-comparison-2026-10-24.md) records which points from the completed first reading were retained or rejected; it also records that a complete follow-up on F090–F094 was unavailable after a cut answer and an API credit rejection. None of these sources replaces the founder's later corrections or a real builder run.
